T1  - Comparison of an Oral Factor Xa Inhibitor With Low Molecular Weight Heparin in Patients With Cancer With Venous Thromboembolism: Results of a Randomized Trial (SELECT-D).
T3  - Comment in: Am J Respir Crit Care Med. 2020 Jul 1;202(1):124-127 PMID: 32392427 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/32392427] Comment in: MMW Fortschr Med. 2021 Dec;163(21-22):82 PMID: 34888823 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/34888823]
