T1  - Treatment of venous thrombosis with intravenous unfractionated heparin administered in the hospital as compared with subcutaneous low-molecular-weight heparin administered at home. The Tasman Study Group.
T3  - Comment in: ACP J Club. 1996 Jul-Aug;125(1):2-3Erratum in: N Engl J Med 1997 Oct 23;337(17):1251Comment in: N Engl J Med. 1996 Mar 14;334(11):724-5 PMID: 8594434 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/8594434] Comment in: N Engl J Med. 1996 Aug 29;335(9):670-1; author reply 671-2 PMID: 8692246 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/8692246] Comment in: N Engl J Med. 1996 Aug 29;335(9):671; author reply 671-2 PMID: 8692247 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/8692247]
