T1  - Aspirin, warfarin, or enoxaparin thromboprophylaxis in patients with multiple myeloma treated with thalidomide: a phase III, open-label, randomized trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1200/JCO.2010.31.6844
A1  - Palumbo, Antonio
A1  - Cavo, Michele
A1  - Bringhen, Sara
