T1  - Inverse relationship of bleeding risk with clot burden during pulmonary embolism treatment with LMW heparin.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/crj.12262
A1  - Wang, Chen
A1  - Zhai, Zhenguo
A1  - Yang, Yuanhua
A1  - Cheng, Zhaozhong
A1  - Ying, Kejing
A1  - Liang, Lirong
A1  - Dai, Huaping
