T1  - Dabigatran after Short Heparin Anticoagulation for Acute Intermediate-Risk Pulmonary Embolism: Rationale and Design of the Single-Arm PEITHO-2 Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1160/TH17-06-0434
A1  - Klok, Frederikus A
A1  - Ageno, Walter
A1  - Barco, Stefano
A1  - Binder, Harald
A1  - Brenner, Benjamin
A1  - Duerschmied, Daniel
A1  - Empen, Klaus
A1  - Faggiano, Pompilio
