T1  - Optimal duration of low molecular weight heparin for the treatment of cancer-related deep vein thrombosis: the Cancer-DACUS Study.
T3  - Comment in: J Clin Oncol. 2014 Nov 10;32(32):3586-7 PMID: 25267742 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/25267742] Comment in: J Clin Oncol. 2015 May 20;33(15):1713 PMID: 25870093 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/25870093] Comment in: J Clin Oncol. 2015 May 20;33(15):1713-4 PMID: 25870095 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/25870095]
