T1  - Efficacy and safety of a low-molecular-weight heparin and standard unfractionated heparin for prophylaxis of postoperative venous thromboembolism: European multicenter trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s002689900185
A1  - Kakkar, V V
A1  - Boeckl, O
A1  - Boneu, B
A1  - Bordenave, L
A1  - Brehm, O A
A1  - Brucke, P
